include ../mixins/evidence.pug

h3(wiki="https://phasmophobia.fandom.com/wiki/Dayan") Dayan
    img(src="ghost-icons/dayan.png")
ul
    li Sanity Hunt Threshold varies based on player movement within 10 meters:
    ul
        li 65% if the player is moving.
        li 45% if the player is still.
        li 50% if no player is within 10 meters.
    li When Hunting, if a player is within 10 meters, the ghost moves at a fixed speed based on player movement:
    ul
        li Hunting Speed increased by 30% if the player is moving.
        li Hunting Speed decreased by 30% if the player is still.
    li Line of sight speed acceleration accumulates in the background while within the 10-meter range, but only applies once the ghost is outside that range.
    li Can only be female.
ul.evidence
    +emf
    +orb
    +box
    +earlyhunt
    +fast
    +slow